{"id": "20547511", "revid": "48023331", "url": "https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=20547511", "title": "Paul Foley (admiral)", "text": "Paul Foley Jr. (August 12, 1909 \u2013 July 7, 1990) was a Rear Admiral in the United States Navy. About 1937, he married the artist Cornelia MacIntyre Foley (1909\u20132010). During World War II, while a commander commanding a PBY Catalina squadron in the Aleutians, Foley was involved in the recovery of the Akutan Zero. Upon his death in 1990 Foley was buried at Arlington National Cemetery."}
